cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "quantum-graphs: quantum graphs of photonic waveguide networks"
abstract: >-
  Python tools to simulate quantum graphs (networks of one-dimensional
  waveguides joined at vertices) in the vertex scattering-matrix formalism:
  spectra and eigenmodes of closed graphs, scattering matrices and resonances
  of open graphs, spectral statistics compared with random-matrix theory,
  classical ray dynamics and periodic orbits. Written to model integrated
  photonic circuits of waveguides and directional couplers.
